{
  "id": "social01b_awei_headphones",
  "type": "other",
  "displayName": "测评耳机",
  "queueId": "social",
  "blueprint": {
    "startNodeId": "start",
    "nodes": {
      "start": {
        "id": "start",
        "type": "flowStart",
        "inputs": {}
      },
      "n1": {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "新买的耳机终于到了，来，给你试听一下。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n1:continue"
        }
      },
      "n2": {
        "id": "n2",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "这是你新买的？看起来很贵啊，你不才买了个黑椒唱片机吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n2:continue"
        }
      },
      "n3": {
        "id": "n3",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "是啊，不错吧，在购物车里放了好久终于等到降价了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n3:continue"
        }
      },
      "n4": {
        "id": "n4",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "你全款买的？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n4:continue"
        }
      },
      "n5": {
        "id": "n5",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "……还没付尾款。到底听不听？赶紧的。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n5:continue"
        }
      },
      "n6": {
        "id": "n6",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "音质很……好，声场比较强，有空间感，高音甜中音稳低音沉……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n6:continue"
        }
      },
      "n7": {
        "id": "n7",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "你有没有听到什么奇怪的声音？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n7:continue"
        }
      },
      "n8": {
        "id": "n8",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "什么？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n8:continue"
        }
      },
      "n9": {
        "id": "n9",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "这里，我放大点，你仔细听。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n9:continue"
        }
      },
      "n10": {
        "id": "n10",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "什么也没听出来啊。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n10:continue"
        }
      },
      "n11": {
        "id": "n11",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "难道是我幻听了？我总觉得这里有点底噪，但只有我听到第37秒会有。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n11:continue"
        }
      },
      "choice12": {
        "id": "choice12",
        "type": "choice",
        "inputs": {
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "是什么声音？"
            },
            {
              "label": "要不你换首歌试试？"
            }
          ],
          "optionCount": 2,
          "selectionKey": "dlg:choice12:select"
        }
      },
      "choice12_op0": {
        "id": "choice12_op0",
        "type": "applyPublicVariableEffect",
        "inputs": {
          "delta": 5,
          "id": 41
        }
      },
      "n13": {
        "id": "n13",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "一种……好像谁在说话。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n13:continue"
        }
      },
      "n14": {
        "id": "n14",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "是不是这首歌里本来就有的？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n14:continue"
        }
      },
      "n15": {
        "id": "n15",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "我对《月之暗面》比对《外科学》还熟悉，怎么会搞错？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n15:continue"
        }
      },
      "n16": {
        "id": "n16",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "肯定是你听错了，你是不是背着大家在偷偷复习医师资格证考试压力太大？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n16:continue"
        }
      },
      "n17": {
        "id": "n17",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "说你自己呢吧……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n17:continue"
        }
      },
      "choice12_op1": {
        "id": "choice12_op1",
        "type": "applyPublicVariableEffect",
        "inputs": {
          "delta": -5,
          "id": 41
        }
      },
      "n18": {
        "id": "n18",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "就是为了听《月之暗面》我才买的这个耳机。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n18:continue"
        }
      },
      "n19": {
        "id": "n19",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "真的没听出来。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n19:continue"
        }
      },
      "n20": {
        "id": "n20",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "或许是这段时间太累了，我休息休息就好了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n20:continue"
        }
      },
      "n21": {
        "id": "n21",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "幻听要去看医生的。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n21:continue"
        }
      },
      "n22": {
        "id": "n22",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "这不用你告诉我。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n22:continue"
        }
      },
